Package: treeTrimmer
Type: Package
Title: Calibrate Hierarchical Clustering Thresholds Using Technical Replicates
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("R. J.", "Eckert", email = "ryan.j.eckert@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides tools to calibrate tree cut heights for clone detection in
    hierarchical clustering analyses. Uses known technical replicates to determine
    the minimum genetic distance threshold at which true clones cluster together.
    Particularly useful for population genetic studies with clonal organisms (corals,
    plants, fungi) where identifying and removing clonal replicates is critical for
    accurate demographic and evolutionary inference.
